# Keamanan & HSTS untuk seluruh aset statis.
# Catatan: redirect domain-level (http:// -> https:// dan www -> apex)
# TIDAK didukung oleh _redirects pada Cloudflare Workers static assets.
# Atur di Cloudflare Dashboard: "Always Use HTTPS" + "Redirect Rules".
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
